{
 "section_summary": "This section contains six secret dossiers on Filipinos in wartime Shanghai. They examine participation in Japanese-sponsored associations, petitions, parades and a Nanking youth trip, while recording conflicting testimony about coercion, collaboration and reports to the Japanese Gendarmerie. The lengthy Gertrudo Kalambakal dossier reproduces propaganda, press accounts and witnesses’ descriptions of the arrests of pro-American Filipinos.",
